## ==========================================
## Build and Publish Artifacts
## ==========================================
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/
publish/

## ==========================================
## User and Sensitive Configuration Files
## ==========================================
# 避免将本地包含个人 API 密钥的配置文件误传至公开仓库
settings.json
settings.user.json
*.user
*.userprefs
*.suo

## ==========================================
## IDE and Editor Temporary Files
## ==========================================
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
*.swp
*.lock
*~

## ==========================================
## External Large Model Weights & Data Cache
## ==========================================
# 排除外部下载的庞大 ONNX 权重文件，内置模型已内嵌于 DLL，保持 Git 仓库轻量
[Mm]odels/**/*.onnx
[Mm]odels/**/*.pdmodel
[Mm]odels/**/*.pdiparams
[Mm]odels/**/*.bin
[Mm]odels/v6/

## ==========================================
## Archives and Large Compressed Files
## ==========================================
*.7z
*.zip
*.rar
*.tar.gz

## ==========================================
## AI Tools and Local Scratch Folders
## ==========================================
.workbuddy/
scratch/

## ==========================================
## Crash dumps and Test outputs
## ==========================================
*.crash
*.dmp
TestResults/
